  "provenance_disclaimer": "Operational microgrid telemetry (power demand, generator dispatch, battery SoC, and fuel rate) for Indian Antarctic stations is not published as public open-access real-time data streams. Therefore, Polarix uses physically grounded synthetic operational data (SYNTHETIC_POLARIX_OPERATIONAL_DATA) conditioned on empirical Antarctic environmental bounds. We never misrepresent synthetic energy values as real historical station telemetry.",
  "canonical_fields": {
